OL,3,GNEWSAEngland over-75s captain awarded
OL,4,Acommemorative cap
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn islander who made his 15th
OL,7,Finternational appearance for the
OL,8,FEngland over-75s football team has been
OL,9,Fawarded a commemorative cap.
OL,11,FGeoff Martel, 81, from Guernsey, was
OL,12,Fpresented with the honour by manager
OL,13,FKen Pollock.
OL,15,FIt comes after he captained the Silver
OL,16,FLions in their 3-2 penalty shootout win
OL,17,Fover Germany in July, which marked the
OL,18,F60th anniversary of the 1966 World Cup
OL,19,FFinal.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
